{
  "title": "Ziyarate Imam Jafar Sadiq (a.s.)",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "اَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ یَا اَمَامَ الْوَریٰ\nalssalamu `alayka ya imama alwara\nPeace be upon you, O Imam of mankind,\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ اَیُّهَا الْعُرْوَۃُ الْوُثْقیٰ\nalssalamu `alayka ayyuha al`urwatu alwuthqa\npeace be upon you, O the firmest handhold,\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ یَا حَبْلَ اللّٰهِ الْمَتِیْنِ\nalssalamu `alayka ya habla allahi almatini\npeace be upon you, O the strong rope of Allah,\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ یَانُوْرَهُ الْمُبِیْنِ\nalssalamu `alayka ya nurahu almubina\npeace be upon you, O His manifest light,\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ اَیُّهَا الصَّادِقُ جَعْفَرُ ابْنُ مُحَمَّدٍ\nalssalamu `alayka ayyuha alssadiqu ja`faru bnu muhammadin\npeace be upon you, O the truthful, Ja`far the son of Muhammad,\nخَازِنُ الْعِلْمِ الدَّاعِیْ اِلَی اللّٰهِ بِالْحَقِّ\nkhazinu al`ilmi alddda`i ila allahi bilhaqqi\nthe keeper of knowledge, the one who calls to Allah with truth.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ كَمَا جَعَلْتَهٗ مَعْدِنَ كَلاَمِكَ وَوَحْیِكَ \nallahumma kama ja`altahu ma`dina kalamika wa wahyika\nO Allah, just as You made him the source of Your speech and Your revelation,\nوَخَازِنَ عَلْمِكَ وَلِسَانَ تَوْحِیْدِكَ\nwa khazina `ilmika wa lisana tawhidika\nand the keeper of Your knowledge and the tongue of Your Oneness,\nوَوَلِیَّ اَمْرِكَ وَمُسْتَحْفِظَ دِیْنِكَ\nwa waliyya amrika wa mustahfiza dinika\nand the authority over Your command and the safeguarder of Your religion,\nفَصَلِّ عَلَیْهِ اَفْضَلَ مَا صَلَّیْتَ عَلیٰ اَحَدٍ مِنْ\nfasalli `alayhi afdala ma sallayta `ala ahadin\nso send blessings upon him – the best of what You have sent upon anyone\nَوْصِیَائِكَ وَحُجَجِكَ\nmin awsiya'ika wa hujajika\nof Your successors and Your arguments –\nاِنَّكَ حَمِیْدٌ مَجِیْدٌ۔\ninnaka hamidun majidun\nindeed You are Praiseworthy, Glorious."
}
